 .../MemoryResources/OverAlignedAllocation.hxx | 89 +++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 include/MGIS/MemoryResources/OverAlignedAllocation.hxx

